---
import SectionHeading from "../shared/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-stone-50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="How They Connect"
      headline="These capabilities work best together."
      subhead="A better message often can't hold if the systems behind it can't deliver on it. A better strategy often can't move without an experience built to carry it out."
    />
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600">
      EverCompass treats these capabilities as connected, not separate — because
      the businesses that get unstuck are usually the ones where strategy,
      experience, message, and system are solving the same problem together.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
